    {
      "resource": "00001944.fpb",
      "kind": "fpb",
      "expected_sha256": "77b8d80bb0989adfe2b7b73b4a06831f00774e036b5128db69b6fc35b097ca94",
      "cached_copies": 0,
      "targets": [
        {
          "seq": 0,
          "target": "哈……哈……哈……哈……",
          "source_sha256": "f25daef2220bfab791e1ef330d9dd8d3da02aad88339090320feba9e35058a04",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 1,
          "target": "啊……！",
          "source_sha256": "d4a5af9f669bd16359b6e303b34a338d549174af010e2fd58b51ff56b96dfde6",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 2,
          "target": "再往前走一点，就到村子了。$n应该能找到照顾你的人。",
          "source_sha256": "7abd3c298a3190f3ec2c73c5306a137687f6aff330e2c8179017545370e89fc2",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 3,
          "target": "呜……可是……都是因为我……$n风月林才……",
          "source_sha256": "36c1a6837d2a86fb4f00d902f2dbc42b78043d52d3d7e20ba7a1e7012cc1dda5",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 4,
          "target": "风月林不是因为你才毁灭的。$n那些家伙只是来夺回东西。",
          "source_sha256": "576da8a61e0ed27c0392a2fa61562301dc02eb8e9c2ce1e84303c75f9a8d3bd2",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 5,
          "target": "什么？",
          "source_sha256": "b283147c6d803aaccb83490b2e161f0625accb938bb16eac82cd8ba2d3e83a9d",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 6,
          "target": "你渴望力量吗？即使双手染上鲜血，$n你也想守护自己珍视的东西吗？",
          "source_sha256": "a93e65a4fb730e23752365161086fb8b867f4367d73414e8a3c5a87bd76f73ec",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 7,
          "target": "那就跟我来。",
          "source_sha256": "06a3b0f40b5969a02625b4cda7977ad0a29abdf42a20ab47fc6f8be9e1795399",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 8,
          "target": "我想变得强大。$n但那时，我想要的$n并不是守护什么的力量。$n我想要的是……摧毁什么的力量。",
          "source_sha256": "71f98b373fbca385f0f15bdd5d3fe17db981af2113c0ca807c0b13ac4ae02545",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "resource": "00004060.fpb",
      "kind": "fpb",
      "expected_sha256": "27c2d9802b11ab4c7617a4cc47e9af5381e827b34f1a729757c836b29aeb183a",
      "cached_copies": 0,
      "targets": [
        {
          "seq": 0,
          "target": "同伴对队长的友好度$n可以在露营模式中调整。$n靠近存档点，按○键，$n就能进入露营模式。",
          "source_sha256": "c0c5fc491c0408f79972afd78b66c8f16e0b70c1fba6beba44470fb462a1b6fc",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 1,
          "target": "进入露营模式后，可以选择一名同伴，与其交谈或赠送礼物。",
          "source_sha256": "7165ec0f26fae647e4b6ad02475cbf621c22dd4621c87ddc7e7f6062f11df9d9",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 2,
          "target": "交谈时选择的回答，以及赠送的礼物，都会改变同伴对队长的友好度。",
          "source_sha256": "7f05bd014d734b406295a266c2be46fa30856f01ac7c0790fb82d805e19eb046",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 3,
          "target": "不同的选择可能提高友好度，也可能降低友好度。",
          "source_sha256": "67e68fb783b8a665dc0954d880838cd2e5a8195398185ee9471b11833917d680",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 4,
          "target": "友好度会影响统率力，而统率力决定战斗中的行动次数。例如，统率力相同时，友好度越高，能进行的行动就越多。",
          "source_sha256": "2cfe825d3a39c51bd805a485a5ff71800b5d9623dfeb5191c4b6df0e4ad57666",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 5,
          "target": "礼物带来的友好度变化只是暂时的，过一段时间便会逐渐恢复。交谈带来的变化$n则会保留一部分。因此，交谈时需要更慎重。",
          "source_sha256": "6cbb04b5f6b2646c185b6ef1e369e02d0d2ef033d1de4a082eccfcc2102447e3",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 6,
          "target": "还有一点需要注意：$n想靠送礼提高友好度时，$n反复给同一名同伴送相同的礼物，$n效果并不会一直增加。",
          "source_sha256": "f75842aff76d262b97d0056da82be1c2159ea2afdd185c876a72df6a19c6b1f9",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 7,
          "target": "就像再美味的食物，吃得太多也会腻一样。",
          "source_sha256": "aff2cf1f28076de6464cf96e48c2f81b47c443578fdafc84b69cb27909515e44",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 8,
          "target": "通过交谈模式，可以了解同伴的心情和各种信息，记得经常查看。",
          "source_sha256": "af3eab1bd56bc4d00e4d2b2d51f7ab731bbc63627deeef9a50716cb466dfb1bf",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 9,
          "target": "队长，你知道露营模式怎么使用吗？",
          "source_sha256": "9e8045e68bc6543dc19c0abc80ddc647d77ef03731c0aa50570f1390d7c57767",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 10,
          "target": "不，还不太清楚。",
          "source_sha256": "ab9d85a4d5e169121fee11a2b045ae8e9a79fc197c3a62da2aeaab9ffd35525d",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 11,
          "target": "嗯，我知道。",
          "source_sha256": "bffd2d2d92cbb5dc2b408a35f40f77f47fc2889ebe9e6988856e8d7a0cc28d03",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        },
        {
          "seq": 12,
          "target": "不愧是队长！那就出发吧？",
          "source_sha256": "811fdf3f23394a69e9e87e7dda534a3f07f06d9b552ac3c4adf93a0f86e7375f",
          "translation_status": "trial-draft"
        }
      ]
    },
